that it's not evil.

1720
01:09:02,733 --> 01:09:04,333
This isn't a battle
between men

1721
01:09:04,367 --> 01:09:05,567
and a non-reasoning being.

1722
01:09:05,600 --> 01:09:06,967
Can't you see
it doesn't want to kill

1723
01:09:07,000 --> 01:09:08,533
for the sake of killing?

1724
01:09:08,567 --> 01:09:11,100
It could've done away with all
of US earlier if it wanted to.

1725
01:09:11,133 --> 01:09:13,100
