1746
01:09:51,367 --> 01:09:52,867
Can't you see that's
what it's been doing?

1747
01:09:52,900 --> 01:09:54,900
It's been acting out of fear
and self-preservation.

1748
01:09:54,933 --> 01:09:56,367
It wants to
communicate with US,

1749
