is inside of me.

1754
01:10:05,067 --> 01:10:06,767
Part of him
was inside you, yeah.

1755
01:10:06,800 --> 01:10:09,100
Why not let me
lead US to it?

1756
01:10:09,133 --> 01:10:11,800
In the daylight
in the open.

1757
01:10:11,833 --> 01:10:13,133
Maybe he's got something.

1758
01:10:13,167 --> 01:10:14,467
Yeah, sea monkeys.

1759
01:10:14,500 --> 01:10:16,300
When we were out
searching for the creature,

1760
01:10:16,333 --> 01:10:18,633
- our watches
started running again.
- Oh boy.

1761
01:10:18,667 --> 01:10:20,467
Then, when we
encountered it,

1762
01:10:20,500 --> 01:10:22,700
they stopped.

1763
01:10:22,733 --> 01:10:25,633
On our way back here,
they became active again.

1764
01:10:25,667 --> 01:10:26,967
And now everything's dead.

1765
01:10:27,000 --> 01:10:28,400
You're the only one
interested in this, Steve.

1766
01:10:28,433 --> 01:10:31,400
Now, it's my guess that
the magnetic disturbance

1767
01:10:31,433 --> 01:10:34,200
originated from
two different locations.

1768
01:10:34,233 --> 01:10:35,567
- Well.
- Boy.

1769
01:10:35,600 --> 01:10:38,600
- One for the creature--
- * one more for the road

1770
01:10:38,633 --> 01:10:40,000
and then from you.

1771
01:10:40,033 --> 01:10:42,333
It might be the only thing
that's keeping you alive.

1772
01:10:42,367 --> 01:10:44,467
Herbal life
is keeping him alive.

1773
01:10:44,500 --> 01:10:46,033
If my life has been
given back to me,

1774
01:10:46,067 --> 01:10:47,767
it's for a purpose.

1775
01:10:47,800 --> 01:10:49,300
Trust me.

1776
01:10:49,333 --> 01:10:50,633
And we'll learn why.

1777
01:10:50,667 --> 01:10:52,633
If the creature isn't
what you believe it to be,

1778
01:10:52,667 --> 01:10:54,400
